OL,3,GNEWSAPC who held suspect in headlock
OL,4,Aand punched him 'did nothing wrong', he
OL,5,Atells hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer who repeatedly punched
OL,8,Fa man he was arresting has told a
OL,9,Fmisconduct hearing he "did nothing
OL,10,Fwrong".
OL,12,FPC Richard Williams denies eight
OL,13,Fallegations of using unreasonable force
OL,14,Fduring the incident in May 2023.
OL,16,FHe was one of two North Wales police
OL,17,Fofficers sent to a housing estate in
OL,18,FPorthmadog, Gwynedd, following a report
OL,19,Fof a domestic argument.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
