OL,5,Atells hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe misconduct hearing follows a
OL,8,Fseven-day trial at Caernarfon Crown
OL,9,FCourt in 2025, where he was cleared of
OL,10,Fassault and intentional strangulation.
